<title>USA: Hallmark Capital revises 1996 Q1 loss.</title>
<headline>Hallmark Capital revises 1996 Q1 loss.</headline>
<dateline>WEST ALLIS, Wis. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hallmark Capital Corp said on Thursday it revised the net loss for its first quarter to September 30, to $57,000 or $0.04 per share.</p>
<p>The company said it previously posted a net loss of $81,000 or $0.06 per share.</p>
<p>Excluding a one-time charge for Savings Association Insurance Fund recapitalization, earnings per share were $0.34 compared with earnings of $0.29 per share in the year-ago period.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
